[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11701.91, "timestamp": "03:15:01", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11706.99, "timestamp": "03:15:06", "text": "我觉得20场比赛就够了。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11709.59, "timestamp": "03:15:09", "text": "大概吧。嗯，我觉得只有这一个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11711.79, "timestamp": "03:15:11", "text": "我用……买的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11722.389, "timestamp": "03:15:22", "text": "嗯哼。哦，你身上有Fasmo吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11730.15, "timestamp": "03:15:30", "text": "我想我卸载了它。等待。上帝，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11732.269, "timestamp": "03:15:32", "text": "杰克，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11734.67, "timestamp": "03:15:34", "text": "有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11740.11, "timestamp": "03:15:40", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11743.429, "timestamp": "03:15:43", "text": "总是挥手。你拥有所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11745.95, "timestamp": "03:15:45", "text": "顺便说一句，这种情况已经持续多年了。从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11748.309, "timestamp": "03:15:48", "text": "开始。你不能就这么拥有它，你不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11749.309, "timestamp": "03:15:49", "text": "有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11751.55, "timestamp": "03:15:51", "text": "我的Fasmo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11755.11, "timestamp": "03:15:55", "text": "也一样。真的吗？我患有哮喘。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11758.389, "timestamp": "03:15:58", "text": "已确认。似乎已经安装好了。"}]